---
title: Sequence Diagram 1 – Record a Sale
---
sequenceDiagram
  actor Owner as Shop Owner
  participant UI as New Sale Page
  participant API as Flask API
  participant DB as SQLite DB
  Owner->>UI: choose part, enter quantity, click Save
  UI->>API: POST /api/sales {part_no, quantity}
  API->>DB: SELECT part (price, stock)
  DB-->>API: part row
  alt part found AND quantity <= stock
    API->>DB: UPDATE parts SET stock = stock - quantity (WHERE stock >= quantity)
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO sales (amount = price x quantity)
    API-->>UI: 201 Created {sale}
    UI-->>Owner: "Sale saved" + refresh today's sales
  else part missing / not enough stock / bad quantity
    API-->>UI: 400 or 404 {error}
    UI-->>Owner: show error message
  end
